\f0\fs24 \cf0 # Daily To-Do List Manager\
\
A simple command-line Python program to manage daily tasks. \
\
## Description\
I built this simple task manager in Python to keep track of daily homework and chores. It lets you add new tasks, view your current list, and delete tasks when you finish them.\
\
## Features\
- Add new tasks to the list\
- View all current tasks with numbers\
- Delete tasks by entering their list number\
- Menu loop so you don't have to restart the script every time\
\
## How to Run\
\
1. Make sure you have **Python 3** installed on your system.\
2. Download or copy `main.py`.\
3. Open your terminal or command prompt and run:\
\
```bash\
python main.py}